{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は\n震えてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろに気配感じるな〜〜って。\n怖いな〜〜怖いな〜〜()って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして先日\nマネージャーさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ用の服の写真撮ってもらったところ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写ってしまったのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この気配の正体が....."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【閲覧注意】\n※ここから下怖いものが苦手な方は注意してください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/04/07/9199276/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さいミュージシャン風おじさん(？)\nがついてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正体は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不明です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴとっと寄り添うようについてきて\n愛らしいのでそのままにしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引き取り手募集です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(正解は桜井玲香です)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうことじゃなくてーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"震えているのはですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりきりゆいちゃんずステージに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大森靖子(ちゃん)が来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅ちゃんの歌を歌ったらしいのだ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わああああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たかったよ（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良さしかないでしょ。（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか乃木坂の曲もやってほしい......（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コショージさんと2人セゾンも\n世界には愛しかないも熱い（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大森靖子ちゃんの\nアルバムのIDOLSONGにも\n欅ちゃん要素あって羨ましいんだ！！！！！\nでも私も欅坂さん大好きなのだ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう本日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/04/07/9199276/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}